        "raw": "<p>I have a copy of the original edition of the base SotM game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know it&#39;s been a long time since Enhanced Edition came out, but I have the following question:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Which cards do I need to update Standard Edition to Enchanced Edition?&nbsp; And how many of each of those cards do I need to order?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In particualr I&#39;m not interested in cards that just had their wording rephrased or typos fixed.&nbsp; I don&#39;t have interest in Bunker&#39;s &quot;Turrent Mode&quot; which, as far as I can tell right now, just had a simple language fix.&nbsp; What I want to know are the cards that have major rules changes or erratas, like Legacy&#39;s &quot;Inspiring Presence&quot;, Fanatic&#39;s &quot;Absoultion&quot;, or Ra&#39;s &quot;Staff of Ra&quot;.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If such a list already exists, it would be fine to link me or to copy-and-paste.&nbsp; Regardless I thank everyone for your effort</p>",
